Data Visualization
Key Business Insights & Findings
1. 41.4% of all generated orders end up either Cancelled (250 orders) or Returned (247 orders).
This combined revenue leakage totals ₦519,673.91, representing a major operational bottleneck in logistics, product expectations, or payment authorization.
2. Instagram is the top-performing acquisition channel, generating ₦275,285.45 across 259 orders.
3. Product Line Equilibrium: Revenue is evenly distributed across all seven core product categories (ranging from ₦151.7K for Phones up to ₦195.6K for Chairs and Printers).Chairs and Printers deliver the highest total revenue returns, while Laptops feature the highest individual Average Order Value 
Business Recommendations
• Implement automated post-purchase confirmation triggers and review carrier fulfillment performance to mitigate logistics cancellations.
•Increase marketing spend on Instagram paid campaigns and build targeted retargeting flows for existing email lists.
